anager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and it opened once as INC-0001. The description covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up items.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and passes health checks.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01AYNV1zbZ3qN1qBJke9gVaU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0172R2EfQSuoaXtF6Adbf17v", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both marked unhealthy, and v2.3.0 has a healthy history, so it doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01S7yoVMVaVvhCxJpEmrVJAL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013JEqxZbybP199oM