mpt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and it opened once as INC-0001. The description covers the rollback, the partial failure, and the follow-up items.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 fails health checks and why the orchestrator halted the first rollout. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and passes health checks.", "type": "text"}]}]}